---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout>
  <section class="hero">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Software · Systems · People</span>
      <h1>Building things.<br /><em>Making sense</em> of them.</h1>
      <p class="lede">I’m Chris. I work across software engineering and technical leadership, with an interest in how complex systems—and the teams behind them—can work well.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/about">A little about me <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
    <aside class="hero-aside">
      <strong>Beyond the work</strong>
      This site also makes room for ideas outside software: technology, science, history, philosophy, culture and the questions that connect them.
    </aside>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div><span class="eyebrow">01 / A wider lens</span><h2>Work is one part of it.</h2></div>
      <p>Some threads I keep coming back to.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="interest-grid">
      <article class="interest"><span class="number">01</span><h3>Engineering</h3><p>Reliable systems, thoughtful trade-offs and the craft of making useful software.</p></article>
      <article class="interest"><span class="number">02</span><h3>Technology & AI</h3><p>Understanding what is changing, what matters and what deserves a closer look.</p></article>
      <article class="interest"><span class="number">03</span><h3>Ideas & culture</h3><p>Following ideas across science, history, philosophy, society and culture.</p></article>
      <article class="interest"><span class="number">04</span><h3>Life beyond code</h3><p>New places, different perspectives, good conversations and time away from a screen.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="feature-band">
      <div><span class="eyebrow">02 / Engineering</span><h2>Good systems make room for people.</h2></div>
      <div><p>Engineering is technical work, but it is also a practice of making decisions together. I’m interested in the systems, constraints and habits that help teams build with clarity.</p><a class="text-link" href="/engineering">Explore engineering <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div><span class="eyebrow">03 / Journal</span><h2>Notes in the making.</h2></div>
      <a class="text-link" href="/journal">Visit the journal <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
    <p class="lede">A place for longer thoughts and useful discoveries. New pieces will appear here as they’re ready.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
